[[6,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237705\">1076B50</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237446\">1008A44</a></p>"],[2047,127,0,"<p><a href=\"#/3237644\">1092G10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237641\">1092A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237647\">1092G20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237498\">1032D12</a></p>"],[6,127,0,"<p><a href=\"#/3237469\">1020A20</a></p><p>1. Unscrew fixing screws (1a) and remove engine  oil intake horn\n(1b) and its gasket.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2014235.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[6,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit engine oil intake horn and put its\ngasket between.</p><p><a href=\"#/3237469\">1020A20</a></p>"],[2047,127,0,"<p><a href=\"#/3237498\">1032D12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237647\">1092G20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237641\">1092A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237644\">1092G10</a></p>"],[6,127,0,"<p><a href=\"#/3237446\">1008A44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237705\">1076B50</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a></p>"],[264,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the vehicle on the ramp.</p><p>Ensure that the ignition key is in the\nOFF position, then disconnect the negative battery terminal.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3235044\">A1B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Drain the air conditioner coolant circuit\n\n                                          <a href=\"#/3238305\">5040A10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238221\">4450B04</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238307\">5040A20</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238308\">5040A26</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237652\">1016A40</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237564\">1076A48</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237586\">1080B62</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237469\">1020A20</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Undo the bolt securing the engine oil intake to the main bearing\ncap.</p><p>2. Undo the bolts (2a) and remove the engine oil inlet (2b) and\nits gasket.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2014735.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[264,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Place the engine oil inlet, complete with\ngasket, back in its housing and secure it using the bolts.</p><p>Tighten the engine oil air intake bolt\nto the main bearing cap.</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237469\">1020A20</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237586\">1080B62</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237564\">1076A48</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237652\">1016A40</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238308\">5040A26</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238307\">5040A20</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238221\">4450B04</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Fill the air conditioner coolant circuit\n\n                                          <a href=\"#/3238305\">5040A10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Connect the negative (-) battery terminal.</p><p>Remove the car from the ramps.</p>"],[576,127,0,"<p><a href=\"#/3237469\">1020A20</a></p>"],[128,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237758\">1016A10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237609\">1084A16</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237469\">1020A20</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237869\">1084B28</a>\n                                           .</p>"],[128,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237869\">1084B28</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237469\">1020A20</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237609\">1084A16</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Refill the engine oil lubrication system \n\n                                          <strong>- 0010T11 engine oil check level and top up</strong>\n                                 